{"finding_id": "P05-040", "scene_id": "SC29248fbcf75fe78f", "row_ids": ["SFWad72d6a86e3611cc63332008", "SFWca4cca75f4de1abc5fbd11b0", "SFW373e610402c5eec060718799", "SFW87ed6c61eb40d9235caa6b30", "SFWb80a63cde268c59750951ffd", "SFW6b84e2714c498964a87c22ea", "SFW8008639b335602c7471ecd91"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "[SO ENDS THE REPORT ON PLANET TUTONE.]\n[A PLANET WITH A TUMULTUOUS HISTORY, FACING THE GREATEST CHALLENGES OF ITS TIME]\n[SAVED BY THE VALIANT EFFORTS OF TWO BRAVE COSMOBREEDERS:]\n[YIFFANY YIFFAI, ELDER SISTER AND SEASONED VETERAN WITH UNMATCHED COMBAT SKILL]\n[AND YIFFAI YIFFAI, THE YOUNGER BROTHER PRODIGY WITH UNENDING ENTHUSIASM]\n[WITH THE TWO OF THEM TEAMED UP, THERE'S NO MISSION THAT THEY CAN'T HANDLE]\n[AND THE PPP IS PROUD TO HAVE THEM AS AGENTS.]                      -SIGNED, BOSSU", "current_quote": "text: [图托恩星球的报告到此结束。]\ntext: [这是一颗历史动荡的星球，直面着它所处时代最严峻的挑战]\ntext: [被两位勇敢的宇宙育种者奋勇拯救：]\ntext: [伊法妮·伊法伊，姐姐，久经沙场的老兵，拥有无与伦比的战斗技巧]\ntext: [以及伊法伊·伊法伊，热情永不枯竭的天才弟弟]\ntext: [两人携手，没有他们应付不来的任务]\ntext: [PPP很荣幸有他们两位这样出色的特工。]                      -署名，Bossu", "proposed_zh": "图托恩星球的报告到此结束。\n这颗历经动荡、面临空前危机的星球，因两位勇敢的宇宙育种者奋战而获救：\n姐姐伊法妮·伊法伊，经验丰富，战斗技巧无可匹敌；弟弟伊法伊·伊法伊，天赋出众，始终热情满怀。\n两人携手，就没有应付不了的任务。PPP以拥有这样的特工为荣。\n——波苏", "reason": "结尾是Bossu署名报告，不是无归属的全知性格定论；当前“直面着…被…奋勇拯救”跨框连读僵硬。重建报告句法，保留原署名、姓名长幼与赞扬归属；实际控制标签和输出节点不得据此直接合并。", "evidence_refs": ["vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn::vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn", "vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn#vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn:55", "vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn#vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn:56", "vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn#vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn:57", "vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn#vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn:58", "vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn#vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn:59", "vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn#vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn:60", "vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn#vsn/f_EndingGood/script.vsn:61", "V845b6a016df96768b39e", "Vd46aa4a475aa9cf54989", "V253b673b7ba9b896d499", "Vfc59233e6b01bdfa54de", "V487fc49ba19acb850